 "title": "Grain Marketing Nebraska | Grain Bids Online - Frontier Cooperative",
 "text": "Grain Marketing Nebraska | Grain Bids Online - Frontier Cooperative\nMain\nUtilities\nGrain\nCash Bids\nCurrent Bid Sheet\nGrain Historical Bid Data\nFutures\nGrain ACH Form\nWeather\nAgronomy\nUltimate Acre System\nEnergy\nEnergy Overview\nResidential Propane\nPetroleum Order Form\nNutrition\nFeed Products\nGrain Bank Policy\nAbout\nValues, Mission, Vision\nBoard of Directors\nSenior Leadership\nCredit Application\nContact Us\nCareers\nApply Now\nInternships\nScholarships\nCareer Pathway Program\nFrontier Academy\nSafety\nPlanning Services\nNews\nCareers\nLocations\nContact Us\nCustomer Login\nSafety\nPlanning Services\nNews\nLocations\nContact\nCustomer Login\nFrontier Grain\nMarkets are inherently volatile and unpredictable, which is why it pays to develop a marketing plan built for your operation.\nCash Bids\nFutures\nCurrent Bid Sheet\nHistorical Grain Bids\nWeather\nFrontier Cooperative\nA marketing plan helps secure a profitable price for your crop, and, depending on the strategy you choose, it can provide the opportunity for additional gains should market prices spike.\nThe grain marketing professionals at Frontier Cooperative are dedicated, knowledgeable advisors focused on your success. We custom build profit-based marketing plans to help achieve your farm business goals. In addition, if you are working with our agronomy department, we will create a plan that flows seamlessly with your cropping plans.\nBy utilizing a plan with specific profit targets, we’re able to reduce or eliminate the impulsive and emotional decisions that often result in less-than-desirable outcomes.\nCONTACT US >\nGetting Started\nWe realize that no two customers are the same, so we like to sit down and come up with a plan that will best fit your operation. We talk through your expectations and make sure that you are on board with the end goal.\nOur job is to work alongside you as a team to help you succeed in the long run. We look forward to the opportunity to earn your trust!\nCONTACT US >\nWe also offer brokerage services to complement your profitability plan.\nContracts, Policy, Discounts\nClick to view PDFs\n2026 Fall Discount Schedule\nFrontier Grain Contracts\n2026 Fall Harvest Policy\nGrain Bank Policy\n2026 Wheat Harvest Policy\nBryan Choutka\nSenior VP Grain\nLINCOLN OFFICE\n4665 Innovation Drive\nLincoln, NE 68521\n(402) 937-1800\nfeedback@frontiercooperative.com\nGRAIN\nAGRONOMY\nENERGY\nNUTRITION\nSAFETY\nABOUT\nNEWS\nCAREERS\nLOCATIONS\nCONTACT\nCUSTOMER LOGIN\nCONNECT WITH FRONTIER\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n|\nSite Map\n© 2026 Frontier Cooperative - All rights reserved\nSearch for:\nMinimum 3 character allowed.",
